  - m_CharaType: 3
    m_Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f2541a3c484b8cf4eb9ce2f31b171a2d, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: Cheater
    m_Description: Originally worked as a dealer at a casino, but after being caught
      cheating by a customer, he was stabbed from behind and killed after work.
  - m_CharaType: 4
    m_Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ad5906da74654f44baa7919a5819bc03, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: RichMan
    m_Description: Originally a commoner, he suddenly came into money after obtaining
      a certain pot, and in the end, was killed by his five wives for his inheritance.
  - m_CharaType: 5
    m_Icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0fdb9feb6151fd34c93db126451ccd9a, type: 3}
    m_CharacterName: Debtor
    m_Description: He was a gambling addict who always had no money and even sold
      his own organs.
